Approximately how many days has the C2 been active?
Given:
let c2_domain = "update-cdn-service.xyz";
let compromised_ips = DnsEvents
| where query_name contains c2_domain
| distinct client_ip;
DnsEvents
| where client_ip in (compromised_ips)
| where query_name contains c2_domain
| summarize
    first_beacon = min(timestamp),
    last_beacon = max(timestamp),
    total_queries = count()
  by client_ip
This one's a doozy - it looks at the C2 domain and DNS logs. It will look in the DNS logs for the C2 domain and unique client (internal) IPs querying the C2 domain. Then, it will look for the compromised IPs (the ones going to the C2 domain) and summarize the results for us: it will give us the first becaon, the last one, and the numberof queries that were sent. It then sorts it all by client (internal) IP.
Answer: 4
